### Login as the disposable benchmark ADMIN first. Keep credentials local.
POST {{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{benchmark_email}}",
  "password": "{{benchmark_password}}"
}

### Full production replacement Before baseline (server creates and cleans its fixture)
POST {{base_url}}/api/v2/admin/benchmarks/bulk-write/accommodation-amenity-delete
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: SESSION_ID={{session_id}}
X-Bulk-Write-Benchmark-Token: {{bulk_write_benchmark_token}}

{
  "variant": "BEFORE",
  "measurement": "FULL_REPLACEMENT",
  "dataset_size": 30
}

### Repository-derived-delete-only diagnostic (never pool with full replacement)
POST {{base_url}}/api/v2/admin/benchmarks/bulk-write/accommodation-amenity-delete
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: SESSION_ID={{session_id}}
X-Bulk-Write-Benchmark-Token: {{bulk_write_benchmark_token}}

{
  "variant": "BEFORE",
  "measurement": "DELETE_ONLY",
  "dataset_size": 30
}
